      "message": "Why is this different depending on whether NCM is in use or not? That\u0027s suprising and I wonder if it indicates a bug. Can you add a comment?\n\nIf this is due to the order in which testUsbFunctionConfigurationChange does things (i.e., first NCM, then RNDIS), then maybe make this number a parameter to this method and have testUsbFunctionConfigurationChange pass in the number.\n\nIs it just because mUsbManager is not reset between the two? If so, maybe call clearInvocations(mUsbManager) after the verifyUsbTetheringStopDueToSettingChange in line 2644?",
