      "side": 1,
      "message": "It looks like this test is checking what happens when changing the setting on a device that supports both NCM and USB. If so, might want to put this resources configuration at the beginning of this test (e.g., line 2640)? That would be more realistic, because on such a device, the regexps always need to match both NCM and RNDIS, and the resources typically won\u0027t change at runtime.",
